  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use the Linguistics skill to find a loophole (new skill use) in any mind-affecting effect other than a curse. If the effect was language-dependent, the new save is attempted with a +4 insight bonus. You end the effect if the new saving throw succeeds. This is a harmless language-dependent, mind-affecting effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
